  "title": "Boba Fett Relives His Struggle in the Sarlacc Pit",
  "description": "As Boba Fett reached the tree, he grabbed onto one of the lower limbs, and shimmering red eyes appeared throughout the inky darkness. The tree twisted and enveloped Fett, drawing him in. Images and feelings of being swallowed up by the sarlacc surround him, and he sinks lower and lower. Boba's struggles are all in his head, and he fights against memories of losing his father and of Kamino. Finally, Fett dreams of breaking free of the sarlacc, and having snapped free of the mystical tree, he had made it through."
